  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nicaragua joined together for a sustainable national response in the reduction of tuberculosis and mortality, with emphasis on vulnerable populations and based on a family and community health model - Nicaragua (01-Jan-2019-30-Jun-2019)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nicaragua, Tuberculosis, Instituto Nicarag&#xfc;ense de Seguridad Social (INSS)This program has the following goals: Reduce the TB burden at 25% by 2020 // Reducir la Carga de TB en 25% al 2020.  Reduce the TB mortality rate in 35% by 2020 // Reducir la mortalidad de TB en 35% al 2020. The objectives of this program are: Contribute to the prevention and integrated TB care focusing on people affected by Tuberculosis // Contribuir en la prevenci&#xf3;n y la atenci&#xf3;n integrada de la TB centrada en personas afectadas por Tuberculosis.  Strengthen the political commitment , the capacity of the National Program , communities , social organizations, public and private providers in prevention, care and TB control // Fortalecer el compromiso pol&#xed;tico, la capacidad del Programa Nacional, las comunidades, organizaciones sociales y  proveedores p&#xfa;blico privados  en la prevenci&#xf3;n, atenci&#xf3;n  y control de la TB.  Contribute to operational, epidemiological and clinical research, implementation of initiatives and new technologies of rapid diagnostics for tuberculosis control // Contribuir con la investigaci&#xf3;n operativa, epidemiol&#xf3;gica y cl&#xed;nica, implementaci&#xf3;n de iniciativas y nuevas tecnolog&#xed;as de diagn&#xf3;sticos r&#xe1;pidos para el control de la tuberculosis</narrative>
  </description>
